1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,210
Because these constants span many powers of ten, we use their negative logarithms.

2
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:09,088
p K a is minus log K a.

3
00:00:09,088 --> 00:00:19,283
For acetic acid, K a is one point eight times ten to the minus five, so p K a is five minus log one point eight, four point seven four.

4
00:00:19,283 --> 00:00:22,942
Remember: small p K a, strong acid.

